# Bench output is environment-specific; keep the dir but ignore generated files.
# Whitelist the per-stage SUMMARY.md / MODEL_DECISION.md and the canonical CSV
# we explicitly check in as evidence.
*.csv
*.log
*.png
*.json
*.md
!.gitignore
!README.md
!stage*/SUMMARY.md
!stage*/MODEL_DECISION.md
# Stage A unblock: in-place MooncakeConnector patch evidence is committed to
# the repo so the operator can reproduce the failure mode and the patch's
# effect without re-running the cluster. These files are small and stable.
!stage*/MC_PATCH_NOTE.md
!stageA/patch_confirmation.log
!stageA/worker_init_blocker.log
!stageA/prefiller_full.log
!stageA/decoder_full.log
!stageA/install_mooncake_init.log
# A single canonical CSV per stage may be checked in by name; commit it
# explicitly with `git add -f` if needed, or place under a subdir.
!stage*/*-to-*.csv
# Phase 2 analytical artifacts are evidence — small, stable, and what
# downstream phases (3+) reason from. Whitelist the canonical filenames
# explicitly so the catch-all *.md / *.csv / *.png above doesn't drop them.
!phase2_analytical/PHASE2_PICK.md
!phase2_analytical/MODEL_AND_EQUATIONS.md
!phase2_analytical/lambda_max_predictions.csv
!phase2_analytical/PAPER_FIG8_REGEN.png
